message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
title: "real & rendered"
abstract: >-
  An eight-day gallery installation that gives a room machine perception and a voice:
  two depth sensors, a brain-encoding model and a local vision-language pipeline that turn
  each visitor's presence into a live point cloud and a stream of short, spoken perceptions.
type: software
authors:
